      "content": "the dates were the 4th, 11th, and 18th. they all happen at like 5am too. why would they do major water main work at 5am on a tuesday? it feels like they specifically chose times when everyone is asleep so no one notices the equipment they're digging up. i've got the crew's logs too, they keep referencing \"sub-surface acoustic testing\" instead of just saying pipe repairs. that sounds super suspicious right? like they're actually testing sensors.",
